, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Image.png", "id": "1476475376951035", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618284_1476475383617701_745538210780508463_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jthaYO-6rwwQ7kNvwElW38k&_nc_oc=AdpH2iuhK4JzlCMtAOgNpCWxvdAnm-z-VIdlviO1YYflVNDxqEJxbAsy150u_h1UvTQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO5M9TFyLMzPG3L3LOa2vAVh5mmSPyWYqe3IYJmaeERmw&oe=6ACCE1DA"}, "display_name": "Speedway Race Clash: Ultimate Showdown", "keywords": ["Racing", "Formula1", "Cars", "Driving", "Simulator"], "long_description": "Speedway Race Clash: Ultimate Showdown brings the adrenaline of real racing into virtual reality.\nChoose from Formula 1, Muscle, and Classic cars, and test your driving skills across multiple tracks designed for pure speed and competition.\n\nKey Features:\n- 3 racing categories: Formula 1, Muscle, and Classics.\n- 9 unique tracks with different challenges and atmospheres.\n- Unlock cars by winning races and proving your skill.\n- Immersive VR driving that captures the thrill of real competition.\n- Optimized for comfort and smooth gameplay.\nWhether you\u2019re chasing the perfect lap time or unlocking your dream car, Speedway Race Clash: Ultimate Showdown delivers an intense racing experience built for VR.\nAre you ready to hit the track and claim your place at the top?", "short_description": "Speedway Race Clash: Ultimate isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s a shared ride. Built for speed, tuned for chaos, and designed to evolve with you. Every crash, drift, and victory helps shape what comes next.\n\nI\u2019ll keep updating based on your feedback, and if enough racers join the clash, I\u2019ll bring in new cars, fresh tracks, and even multiplayer battles. This isn\u2019t just my game\u2014it\u2019s ours. \n\nSo buckle up, hit the track, and let\u2019s build something unforgettable together!!!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "ht